# ---- the box clock (optional — on by default) ----
# These containers have no NTP daemon (init is init.sh; no systemd, no chrony),
# and on 2026-09-14 every fleet box was 66-464s SLOW — which expires cached
# GitHub App tokens early and skews every age comparison the box makes.
# bin/clock-sync.sh (cron */30) sets the clock from api.github.com's Date header
# when the offset passes the tolerance, and does nothing at all when a real NTP
# daemon is running. flags/clock-sync-off is the same switch as a file.
#CLOCK_SYNC=1
#CLOCK_SYNC_TOLERANCE=30
#CLOCK_SYNC_SOURCES=https://api.github.com https://www.cloudflare.com

